Fresh recurrence on [main nightly #88743 H100 FusedMoE Layer Kernels](https://buildkite.com/vllm/ci/builds/88743/jobs/01a09e82-831c-4f0a-9661-c52120a21f57) at `10e8d5614c50ad180acbe61878c93d98ca7098a9`:

- DeepEP low-latency initialization repeatedly emitted `nvshmemi_transport_init ... init failed for transport: IBGDA`;
- the 2x1 EPLB low-latency case then lost process 1 to `SIGSEGV`;
- the later allgather-reduce-scatter case surfaced NCCL `Cuda failure 999: unknown error` from the already-poisoned CUDA state;
- summary: 2 failed / 232 passed / 297 skipped.

This matches the NVSHMEM re-init/crash-propagation family this draft hardens. The existing exact-head H100/B200 proof in #85130 remains green; this recurrence supplies a current main reproduction, not a reason for another unchanged retry.

